            <div xml:id="d374">

                <pb facs="0427" n="319" sameAs="frus:frus1927v02/pg319"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/8739: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-04-21T23:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 21,
                                1927—11 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received April 21—3:37
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>469. My 390, April 9, 1 p.m. Detachments from the Legation guards (American,
                    British, Italian and Japanese) today took over the defense of the wall formerly
                    defended by the Russian Legation guard.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
